    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p><strong>Major Physical Mutation</strong></p><p>Corruptive powers leech life out of a part o your body. Consult the table below to find out which. The affected part of the body is rendered useless, either falling off or hanging like a dry twig. Treat it as having been @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.journals.JournalEntry.NS3YGlJQxwTggjRX.JournalEntryPage.WCivInLZrqEtZzF4#amputated-parts]{amputated}. Roll 1d10 for determining left or right for things like arms and legs: 1-5 Left ; 6-10 Right.</p><p></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p>1d100</p></td><td><p>Body Part</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>01-05</p></td><td><p>Arm</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>06-17</p></td><td><p>Ear</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>18-29</p></td><td><p>Eye</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>30-44</p></td><td><p>Fingers (1d10/2)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>45-49</p></td><td><p>Foot</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>50-54</p></td><td><p>Hand</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>55-59</p></td><td><p>Leg</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>60-70</p></td><td><p>Nose</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>71-80</p></td><td><p>Teeth (fall out)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>81-95</p></td><td><p>Toes (1d10/2)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>96-100</p></td><td><p>Tongue</p></td></tr></tbody></table>"
